speechtext:
The answer the minister gave me a moment ago would have been satisfactory and I thought it was at the time he gave it, but I have now read the explanatory notes. The purposes of this bill are set out as follows:
(a) to specify that the drugs, biologicals and related preparations which may be provided as part of in-patient services may not be given to patients on a take-home basis;
It therefore becomes very complicated for the out-patient, and I understand it is a matter of discretion which might give rise to difficulties when trying to make arrangements.
